---
title: Tiramisu Cream
image: https://images.aws.nestle.recipes/original/tiramisu_iced_latte_principal_horizontal_vrmp.jpg
time required: 2 minutes
servings: 1
---

In a #small cup{}, combine @mascarpone{1%tbsp}, @heavy cream{4%tbsp}, and @vanilla syrup{1%tbsp}(2 Torani pumps) using a #hand frother{}. 

> If your mascarpone is not room temperature, use a spoon for the initial mixing period.